QuestGuidance.Register("es",363,{
[11585]="700551E1\n1\tLas sombras tristes se pueden encontrar en todo el Círculo de Desesperación. Dornach le ha pedido que intente consolar a los espíritus tristes de Minas Morgul para que puedan revelar el destino que les sobrevino. NOTA: Si pierde de vista a Dornach, puede invocarlo a su lado con su cuerno.\t\n2\tHabla con Dornach\tDornach se encuentra en el Círculo de Desesperación. Has intentado consolar a los espíritus tristes de Minas Morgul. Deberías hablar con Dornach. NOTA: Si pierde de vista a Dornach, puede invocarlo a su lado con su cuerno.\n",
[11586]="70026190\n1\tVierte las lágrimas de Ent en el estanque\030Encuentra el estanque en la parte superior de los Saltos del Crepúsculo\tEl estanque está en la cima de los Saltos del Crepúsculo, al noreste de las Agujas de la Linde. Erchiel te pidió que te aventures hasta el estanque más alto de los Saltos del Crepúsculo y viertas algunas lágrimas de Ent en su interior para purificar las aguas.\n2\tHabla con Erchiel en las Agujas de la Linde\tErchiel se encuentra en las Agujas de la Linde, al suroeste de los Saltos del Crepúsculo. Erchiel se alegrará de saber que las lágrimas han purificado el agua.\n",
[11587]="70053396\n1\tExamine gladdens near the Gladden Falls ([según el diario]/8)\tGladdens can be found throughout the Gladden Fields, but Radagast is especially interested in those that have grown near the Gladden Falls. Radagast is concerned something has befouled the waters of the Gladden. You should examine gladdens near the Gladden Falls and see if they show any signs of corruption.\n2\tExamine gladdens near the Gladden Falls (7/8)\tGladdens can be found throughout the Gladden Fields, but Radagast is especially interested in those that have grown near the Gladden Falls. Radagast is concerned something has befouled the waters of the Gladden. You should examine gladdens near the Gladden Falls and see if they show any signs of corruption.\n3\tFill Radagast's phial with water from the Gladden Falls\tThe Gladden Falls can be found in the western reaches of the Gladden Fields. Radagast has asked you to fill a phial with water from the Gladden Falls in the hope that it might help him identify and cleanse the blight creeping into the Gladden Fields.\n4\tDeliver the phial of water to the sparrow\tThe sparrow can be found near the Gladden Falls in the Gladden Fields. You have found many blighted gladdens, but it appears that not all of them have succumbed. You also filled a phial with water from the Gladden Falls and you should bring it to the sparrow.\n",
[11588]="7000701C\n1\tEntrega el libro a Asikko\030Recupera el libro de Asikko\tEl libro de Asikko está escondido en algún lugar del campamento de la facción traidora Rauta-lehmä en Nan Amlug, al este del campamento de los Suuri-lehmä. Asikko duda en ir él mismo a recuperar el libro de los Rauta-lehmä por miedo a provocar la guerra demasiado pronto. En su lugar, te ha pedido que recuperes el libro por él.\n2\tHabla con Gondranc\030Recoge Asikko's Book\tGondranc te espera en Esteldín. Has recuperado con éxito el libro de Asikko del campamento de los Rauta-lehmä. El líder de los Hijos de la Tierra te ha pedido que se lo entregues a Gondranc, cumpliendo así su promesa al Montaraz.\n",
[11589]="7004E496\n1\tDefeat prowling battle-cats in Ironfold (total: 6)\tProwling battle-cats can be found roaming outside Utterby in the Ironfold. You have encountered a number of prowling battle-cats and should defeat them.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many prowling battle-cats.\n",
[11590]="70000DE8\n1\tHabla con Bounder Chubb\tEl Frontero Redondo se encuentra en el lado sur de Ojo de Aguja. Filibert Bolger, enfadado por la muerte de su vaca, te ha pedido que hables con el Frontero Redondo sobre el incidente.\n",
[11591]="7001F4B0\n1\tDerrota a Temair la Devota\tTemair se encuentra en la entrada al Arboreto y la Fortaleza, en Garth Agarwen. Arienh te ha pedido que lleves a la líder de los Créoth, una terrible mujer llamada Temair, a la justicia. Ella predica dentro de los confines de Garth Agarwen.\n2\tVuelve con Areinh\tVuelve con Arienh a su campamento en la entrada de Garth Agarwen. Encontraste a Temair exactamente donde Arienh te dijo que estaría. Deshacerte de Temair resultó ser relativamente simple y ahora debes volver con Arienh.\n",
[11592]="7006E117\n1\tInvestigate Dhórgruth\t\n2\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.\n3\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.\n",
[11593]="7006E119\n1\tInvestigate Dhórgruth\t\n2\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.\n3\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.\n",
[11594]="7006E118\n1\tInvestigate Dhórgruth\t\n2\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets\tDefeat Kulkorth and his pets.\n3\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother\tDefeat Maluchon, the Pale Brother.\n",
[11595]="7006DD43\n1\tDefeat Azagath Sea-shadow within the Inner Sanctum\tYou must defeat Azagath and stop him from awakening the creature Gârash.\n2\tSurvive the impending attack\tAzagath fled deeper into the inner sanctum. Your pursuit, cut short by fell magic, leaves you with a feeling of unease. Something is amiss. You must survive. The clamour of battle can be heard in corridors beyond.\n3\tStop Azagath from achieving his goal\tThe ambush is cleared and the door into the deepest part of the sanctum opens. You must proceed deeper, find Azagath and defeat him before he unleashes -- Gârash.\n4\tDefeat the Alad defending Gârash Do not let the Aladi approach Glorfindel or Gandalf\tAzagath's ambition led to his demise before an ancient Morgothian horror. You must stand against this darkness and assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in containing Gârash, the Emptiness and its servants.\n5\tSurvive against Gârash, the Emptiness, and seal it within its sarcophagus\tGârash, the Emptiness begins to swell with power, feeding on the remains of Azagath. Assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in keeping Gârash from leaving the Temple of Utug-bûr.\n",
[11596]="7006DD47\n1\tDefeat Azagath Sea-shadow within the Inner Sanctum\tYou must defeat Azagath and stop him from awakening the creature Gârash.\n2\tSurvive the impending attack\tAzagath fled deeper into the inner sanctum. Your pursuit, cut short by fell magic, leaves you with a feeling of unease. Something is amiss. You must survive. The clamour of battle can be heard in corridors beyond.\n3\tStop Azagath from achieving his goal\tThe ambush is cleared and the door into the deepest part of the sanctum opens. You must proceed deeper, find Azagath and defeat him before he unleashes -- Gârash.\n4\tDefeat the Alad defending Gârash Do not let the Aladi approach Glorfindel or Gandalf\tAzagath's ambition led to his demise before an ancient Morgothian horror. You must stand against this darkness and assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in containing Gârash, the Emptiness and its servants.\n5\tSurvive against Gârash, the Emptiness, and seal it within its sarcophagus\tGârash, the Emptiness begins to swell with power, feeding on the remains of Azagath. Assist Glorfindel and Gandalf in keeping Gârash from leaving the Temple of Utug-bûr.\n",
