[11600]="7006E01C\n1\tInvestigate deeper into Thûr Hin, Lair of the Children Legolas must not falter\tInvestigate Thûr Hin and seek out the two Utûgi ahead.\n2\tListen to Khablag and Daikhag\tListen to Khablag and Daikhag.\n3\tDefeat Khablag Legolas must not falter\tDefeat Khablag.\n4\tListen to Khablag and Legolas\tListen to Khablag and Legolas.\n5\tHeal Legolas! Legolas must not falter All Elven Menders must not falter\tHeal Legolas.\n6\tHeal Legolas and fend off Daikhag Legolas must not falter All Elven Menders must not falter\tHeal Legolas and fend off Daikhag.\n7\tDefeat Daikhag\tDefeat Daikhag.\n8\tPress deeper into Thûr Hin\tPress deeper into Thûr Hin.\n9\tListen to Kormoltur, Lord of Terror\tListen to Kormoltur, Lord of Terror.\n10\tAttack Kormoltur\tAttack Kormoltur.\n11\tDefeat the Utûgi\tDefeat the Utûgi.\n12\tDefeat Kormoltur, Lord of Terror\tDefeat Kormoltur, Lord of Terror.\n",
[11601]="7002EFA8\n1\tHabla con Harding en el Salón del Hidromiel de Hardwick\tAldor Harding está en el Salón del Hidromiel de Harwick. Burnoth te ha pedido que vayas a ver a Aldor Harding y lo convenzas de la necedad de creer en presagios, así como de la sensatez de enviar a las mujeres y a los niños a un lugar seguro.\n",
[11602]="7006715C\n1\tYou were given plates of food to leave on the counters in the Furukzahar feasting-hall before you can eat your own meal.\t\n2\tSet plates of food down on the counters in the Furukzahar feasting-hall (3/4)\tYou were given plates of food to leave on the counters in the Furukzahar feasting-hall before you can eat your own meal.\n3\tTalk to Gírma\tGírma has caught your attention.\n4\tEat the meal you delivered to the feasting-hall\tYou have satisfied the Temámir custom of serving a meal before eating your own, and can now enjoy it yourself.\n5\tTalk to Gírma\tGírma has some advice for you.\n6\tZadók can be found in the Kitchens of Furukzahar if you enjoyed the meal, and if you did not you were told to voice your displeasure to Alem outside the fortress instead.\t\n",
[11603]="7006C6EB\n1\tCollect wild berries from the pond above the waterfall ([según el diario]/15)\tRaphûz asked you to find berries with medicinal qualities at a pond atop a waterfall north-east of the settlement of Iridír.\n2\tDeliver the wild berries to Raphûz at Iridír\tYou collected the berries and felt as though you were being watched. You should return the berries to Raphûz in Iridír.\n",
[11604]="70071B44\n1\tTBD Return to Quest Giver\tTBD Return to Quest Bestower\n",
[11605]="70047450\n1\tPlant seeds in fertile soil in North Ithilien (total: 10)\tFertile soil can be found throughout Ithilien, especially above Henneth Annûn and near the ruins of Aelin Veren, Thargelon, and Bâr Tarnaher. Ereblen has asked you to plant various seeds in the fertile soil of North Ithilien.\n2\tTalk to Ereblen in Henneth Annûn\tEreblen can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have planted all the seeds and should now return to him in Henneth Annûn.\n",
[11606]="70062119\n1\tCalma a la cabra nerviosa\030Calma a la gallina ansiosa\030Calma a la vaca alterada\tLos animales nerviosos pueden encontrarse en el corral cerca de la puerta oriental de Musgovilla. Seren te ha pedido calmar a algunos de los animales nerviosos de Musgovilla.\n2\tHabla con Seren\t\n",
[11607]="7007187E\n1\tCheck on the injured Kinta\tLóburdith in Sul Madásh has asked for your assistance in checking on the Kinta scouts who have returned but have fallen ill from the pale blight and providing medicine if necessary.\n2\tCheck on the injured Kinta\tLóburdith in Sul Madásh has asked for your assistance in checking on the Kinta scouts who have returned but have fallen ill from the pale blight and providing medicine if necessary.\n3\tRetrieve medicine\tLóburdith in Sul Madásh has asked for your assistance in checking on the Kinta scouts who have returned but have fallen ill from the pale blight and providing medicine if necessary.\n4\tGive medicine to the injured Kinta scout\tLóburdith in Sul Madásh has asked for your assistance in checking on the Kinta scouts who have returned but have fallen ill from the pale blight and providing medicine if necessary.\n5\tCheck on the injured Kinta\tLóburdith in Sul Madásh has asked for your assistance in checking on the Kinta scouts who have returned but have fallen ill from the pale blight and providing medicine if necessary.\n6\tReturn to Lóburdith\tReturn to Lóburdith and let her know you have tended to the scouts and administered medicine to the ones who needed it.\n",
[11608]="700272D2\n1\tCura a los guardias heridos (total: 3)\tLos guardias heridos se encuentran a lo largo del frente norte de los Avanc-lûth. Anurin te ha pedido que atiendas a algunos guardias para que sanen rápidamente.\n2\tHabla con Anurin en el Pantano Bruno\tAnurin está en el frente norte de los Avanc-lûth. Deberías volver a ver a Anurin y decirle que has sanado a los guardias.\n",
[11609]="7003FFBB\n1\tHeal injured soldiers (total: 4)\tThe injured must be tended to before their wounds become too great.\n",
[11610]="700442F9\n1\tAiling farmers can be found in the hall at Crithost. You should tend to the wounded.\t\n2\tDistressed refugees can be found in Crithost. You should calm the refugees.\t\n3\tSpeak with Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[11611]="70062135\n1\tRiega retoños (total: 4)\030Habla con... ¿los árboles? (total: 4)\tLos retoños y los árboles pueden encontrarse fuera de la casa de Rendal. Cadi te ha pedido que riegues los retoños y hables con los árboles.\n2\tHabla con Cadi\tTe has ocupado de las plantas en el jardín. Deberías volver con Cadi. Te espera en casa de Rendal en la esquina sudoeste de Herne.\n",
[11612]="7002C9C2\n1\tLleva el colmillo a Sabert en Stangard\tSabert aguarda en la puerta de Stangard. Debes llevarle el colmillo que recogiste del cadáver de la Sierpe Rocosa Ancestral.\n",
[11613]="700261E0\n1\tReprende a los veinteneros en el Laberinto de Setos (total: 4)\tLos revoltosos hobbits veinteneros pueden encontrarse correteando por el Laberinto de Setos.\n2\tHabla con Emma Matorralverde en el Laberinto de Setos\tEmma Matorralverde está de pie fuera del Laberinto de Setos, en los Campos de Caballos de Bree. Debes informar a Emma Matorralverde que has reprendido a varios veinteneros por su comportamiento revoltoso.\n",
[11614]="7006AACA\n1\tYou defeated a watcher tentacle\tYou have defeated a watcher tentacle in Dil-irmíz. Bôgalekh in Jadambor would surely like to hear about this.\n2\tSpeak with Bôgalekh in Jadambor\tSpeak with Bôgalekh in Jadambor in Dil-irmíz.\n",
[11615]="7005297C\n1\tPick up the unusual collar\tPick up the unusual collar and bring it to Varthmath for his opinion on it.\n2\tTalk to Varthmath at the Beorninghús\tVarthmath can be found at the Beorninghús. You should talk to Varthmath about the collar you found.\n3\tFind and defeat the warg leader\tThe warg who once wore the dwarf-collar must be somewhere in the Beorning-lands. You should find and defeat the warg leader.\n4\tTalk to Varthmath at the Beorninghús\tVarthmath can be found at the Beorninghús. You should talk to Varthmath.\n",
[11616]="7000A209\n1\tDerrota a Miluidir antes del amanecer\tMiluidir está en Ost Heryn, al suroeste por el camino desde el campamento de Torogethir. Torogethir te ha pedido que ahuyentes a la sombra de Miluidir en las ruinas de Ost Heryn. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con Torogethir\tTorogethir está en su campamento, al noreste de Ost Heryn. Deberías regresar a Torogethir con noticias de tu éxito.\n",
})
